## Error Handling and Best Practices

### Common Error Codes

| Code | Description | Resolution |
|------|-------------|------------|
| `VALIDATION_ERROR` | Invalid cluster name or parameters | Use lowercase alphanumeric with hyphens only |
| `CONFLICT` | Cluster name already exists | Choose a unique cluster name |
| `RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND` | Cluster ID not found | Verify cluster ID is correct |
| `SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE` | External service error | Check network connectivity, retry |

